"Why CPC and conversion are linked through Quality Score"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Your cost-per-click in Google Ads is not just your bid - it is determined by the ad auction, which accounts for your bid and your Quality Score together. A low Quality Score means you pay more for the same ad position than a competitor with a higher score bidding the same amount."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Quality Score has three components:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3","children":[["$","li","Expected CTR",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":["Expected CTR",": "]}],"How likely Google estimates your ad is to get clicked relative to the keyword. Based on historical performance of the ad and keyword combination."]}]]}],["$","li","Ad Relevance",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":["Ad Relevance",": "]}],"How closely the ad matches the intent behind the keyword. A generic ad running against a specific keyword will have low Ad Relevance."]}]]}],["$","li","Landing Page Experience",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":["Landing Page Experience",": "]}],"How well the landing page matches the keyword and ad promise, loads on mobile, and provides a clear path to conversion. This is the component most commonly rated \"Below Average\" - and the most directly controllable."]}]]}]]}],"$L11"]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17"]}]}]
