11:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Check your Quality Score components now: in Google Ads, go to Keywords → Columns → Modify Columns → Quality Score. Add all three component columns. If Landing Page Experience shows “Below Average,” the page is confirmed as a contributor to both high CPC and low conversion."}]
12:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Two-layer diagnosis: ad layer vs page layer"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"High CPC + low conversion can originate in either layer. Read the Quality Score components to identify which one:"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4","children":[["$","div","Landing Page Experience: Below Average",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border p-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg text-sm","children":"Landing Page Experience: Below Average"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-xs font-bold text-accent bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full","children":"Fix page first"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Page is confirmed contributor. Fix message-match (headline mirrors keyword), mobile LCP (under 2.5s), and above-fold proof before changing any bid settings."}]]}],["$","div","Expected CTR or Ad Relevance: Below Average",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border p-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg text-sm","children":"Expected CTR or Ad Relevance: Below Average"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-xs font-bold text-accent bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full","children":"Fix ad first"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Ad-to-keyword match is the priority. Tighten keyword match types, rewrite ad copy to echo the exact search phrase, or restructure ad groups to reduce keyword-to-ad dilution."}]]}],["$","div","All three components: Average or Above Average",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border p-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg text-sm","children":"All three components: Average or Above Average"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-xs font-bold text-accent bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full","children":"Competitive keyword"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The keyword is genuinely competitive. CPC is driven by competitor bids rather than your Quality Score. Options: accept the CPC and optimise the page for higher conversion to improve ROAS; find lower-competition keyword variants with comparable intent; adjust bidding strategy."}]]}]]}]]}]
13:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Landing page fixes that improve Quality Score"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Google assesses Landing Page Experience on four dimensions: relevance, transparency, navigability, and speed. Each maps to a specific fix:"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-5","children":[["$","div","Relevance",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-5 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Relevance"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted/70 italic mb-2","children":"The page content matches the keyword and ad promise"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Use the exact keyword phrase from your top-traffic ad groups in the page H1. If the keyword is \"landing page conversion audit\" and the H1 is \"Digital Marketing Solutions,\" the relevance signal fails. One-to-one keyword-to-page alignment is the highest-leverage Quality Score fix."}]]}],["$","div","Transparency",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-5 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Transparency"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted/70 italic mb-2","children":"It is clear what the page offers, who provides it, and what the visitor is being asked to do"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Ensure the above-fold section contains: what you do (specific, not vague), who it is for, and one next step. Buried pricing, hidden terms, or a form with no context around it all reduce transparency signals."}]]}],["$","div","Speed",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-5 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Speed"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted/70 italic mb-2","children":"The page loads quickly on mobile"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Check LCP with Google PageSpeed Insights on mobile preset. Target under 2.5 seconds. Portent's 2022 analysis found B2B pages loading in 1 second convert at roughly 3x the rate of pages loading in 5 seconds - so speed improvements improve both Quality Score and conversion rate simultaneously."}]]}],["$","div","Navigation",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-5 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Navigation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted/70 italic mb-2","children":"The visitor can find what they came for without excessive friction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"For a dedicated landing page, this means a clear single-path layout: headline confirms intent, proof builds trust, CTA makes the next step obvious. A page with a navigation bar linking to ten other sections, multiple CTAs, and no clear hierarchy fails this dimension."}]]}]]}]]}]
14:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Why fixing the page improves both CPC and conversion simultaneously"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"A page fix can create a compounding effect: better message-match may raise Landing Page Experience, which can improve Quality Score, which lowers CPC in the auction (per Google's documented mechanics). Separately, the same message-match improvement may help visitors recognise they are in the right place - potentially improving conversion rate, though this outcome is not guaranteed."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The inverse is also clear. Raising your bid to compensate for a low Quality Score is expensive without improving your position proportionally, and it does nothing for conversion rate. The same budget after a landing page fix may buy more clicks at lower CPC and convert more of them - but this depends on whether the specific page conditions were actually the bottleneck."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"This is why high CPC + low conversion is a page problem before it is a bid problem. The bid lever is the last one to adjust - after the page has been fixed and Quality Score has been given time (a few weeks of campaign data) to reflect the improvement."}]]}]
